#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins.rst:279
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| ":guilabel:`Device` You can switch between using the **CPU** or your "
#| "**GPU** for object detection. A GPU supporting CUDA is required for GPU "
#| "object detection. Kdenlive tries to find your graphic card automatically. "
#| "If the graphic card supports CUDA (Nvidia GPU) it will install the "
#| "necessary driver so you can use it. If your graphic card doesn't support "
#| "CUDA or is not detected by Kdenlive you only see CPU. :guilabel:`GPU "
#| "Support` If your Nvidia GPU is not listed, try installing an alternative "
#| "by :ref:`following these steps<gpu-manual_config>`."
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Device` You can switch between using the **CPU** or your **GPU** "
"for object detection. A GPU supporting CUDA is required for GPU object "
"detection. Kdenlive tries to find your graphic card automatically. If the "
"graphic card supports CUDA (Nvidia GPU) it will install the necessary driver "
"so you can use it. If your graphic card doesn't support CUDA or is not "
"detected by Kdenlive you only see CPU. :guilabel:`GPU Support` If your "
"Nvidia GPU is not listed, try installing an alternative by :ref:`following "
"these steps <gpu-manual_config>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Zariadenie` Môžete prepínať medzi použitím **CPU** alebo vašej "
"**GPU** na detekciu objektov. Na detekciu objektov pomocou GPU je potrebná "
"GPU s podporou CUDA. Kdenlive sa pokúša automaticky nájsť vašu grafickú "
"kartu. Ak grafická karta podporuje CUDA (Nvidia GPU), nainštaluje potrebný "
"ovládač, aby ste ju mohli použiť. Ak vaša grafická karta nepodporuje CUDA "
"alebo ju Kdenlive nedeteguje, vidíte iba CPU. :guilabel:`Podpora GPU` Ak "
"vaša Nvidia GPU nie je uvedená, skúste nainštalovať alternatívu :ref:`podľa "
"týchto krokov<gpu-manual_config>`."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins.rst:281
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Offload video to CPU to save GPU Memory` If you have long clips "
"on which Kdenlive has to detect objects you may get a crash. If enabled, "
"this offloads some of the memory used to the RAM instead of the GPU memory."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Presunúť video na CPU na úsporu pamäte GPU` Ak máte dlhé klipy, "
"na ktorých musí Kdenlive detegovať objekty, môže dôjsť k pádu. Ak je "
"povolené, presunie časť použitej pamäte do RAM namiesto pamäte GPU."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins.rst:283
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Use system packages only` When enabled, Kdenlive will use the "
"SAM2 version installed on your system. For advanced users only, as you will "
"have to properly setup everything by yourself."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Používať iba systémové balíky` Keď je povolené, Kdenlive bude "
"používať verziu SAM2 nainštalovanú vo vašom systéme. Iba pre pokročilých "
"používateľov, pretože všetko budete musieť správne nastaviť sami."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins.rst:285
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Models folder` When you click on the link the folder will be "
"opened where the SAM2 models are stored including the size of this folder. :"
"guilabel:`Delete all models` will delete the content of the model folder."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Priečinok modelov` Po kliknutí na odkaz sa otvorí priečinok, kde "
"sú uložené modely SAM2 vrátane veľkosti tohto priečinka. :guilabel:"
"`Odstrániť všetky modely` odstráni obsah priečinka modelov."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins.rst:287
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Plugin size` When you click on the link the folder will be opened "
"where the venv-sam Python scripts are stored including the size of this "
"folder. :guilabel:`Uninstall plugin` will uninstall venv-sam Python."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Veľkosť zásuvného modulu` Po kliknutí na odkaz sa otvorí "
"priečinok, kde sú uložené skripty Python venv-sam vrátane veľkosti tohto "
"priečinka. :guilabel:`Odinštalovať zásuvný modul` odinštaluje Python venv-"
"sam."

